{{feat
|type=class
|prereq=[[arcane archer]]
|desc=With this feat, every arrow an arcane archer nocks and lets fly gets a +1 [[enhancement bonus]]. The bonus only works for the arcane archer. For every 2 levels of arcane archer past 1st, the enhancement goes up by +1.
|use=automatic
|icon=ife_x1encharr.gif
|class1=arcane archer
}}

== Notes ==
*Added in the [[expansion pack]]s.
*The ''enchant arrow'' bonus does not count towards the +20 [[attack bonus cap]].
* Unlike normal enhancement bonuses, the bonus from ''enchant arrow'' [[stack]]s with an attack bonus (on the bow), so both bonuses are added to the attack roll. However for purposes of penetrating [[damage reduction]], they do not combine and only the higher bonus is used.
* Unlike normal enhancement bonuses, the bonus from ''enchant arrow'' stacks with a damage bonus (on the arrow).
*The ''enchant arrow'' attack bonus is reported on the [[character sheet]] for all [[ranged weapon]]s, but that is a display error; in combat, this feat only operates for bows.
